      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُلَاتَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>black filth that is washed away from
the membrane which encloses a young lamb</i> or <i>kid
in its mother's womb.</i> (K, TA.) [For <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُسَالَةُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّخْلَةِ السَّوْدَاءِ</span>, as in the copies of the K in my
hands, I read <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السوداءُ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُلَابَةٌ</span>.]


